    <statement><p>Suppose <m>Q = 33.2(0.74)^t</m>.
Give the starting value <m>a</m>, the growth
<em>factor</em> <m>b</m>, and the
growth <em>rate</em> <m>r</m> if
<m>Q = a \cdot b^t = a(1+r)^t</m>.</p>
<p><m>a =</m>
<fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>b =</m>
<fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
